<title>GERMANY: SKW Trostberg 96 profit, sales edge up.</title>
<headline>SKW Trostberg 96 profit, sales edge up.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>Group profit from operating</p>
<p>    activities				   286     vs 281</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,908   vs 3,875</p>
<p>    Dividend (proposed)			22.0    vs 20.0 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German speciality chemicals company is SKW Trostberg AG. The company said the purchase of Master Builders Technologies (MBT) had turned the group into the world market leader for construction chemicals. MBT was not consolidated in SKW's accounts until December 31, 1996 so it had no impact on SKW's 1996 results, the company said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
